    so we want your parents to read the app''s <u><color=blue><b><link="https://theogkids.com/privacy-policy/">Privacy
    Policy and Terms of Use first.</link></b></color></u>


    If we need your permission
    to use your information, we''ll ask your parents for it. They can decide if they
    want to say yes or no.


    If you''re a kid using this app, we need to make
    sure you have permission from an adult. So, before you can use it, we need your
    parent or guardian to say they''re okay with it.


